{"about_the_game":"<strong>&quot;\u65f6\u7a7a\u4e09\u5206\u4e4b\u4e09 Tritime Space&quot;</strong> is a stand-alone monster-killing game that uses music beats to perform action strikes and release cool skills:<br>1. You can sense the rhythm from the world to strengthen your attack, and you can combine the rhythm and buttons to create different skill output methods! <i>--Rhythm is energy, isn't it?</i><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164170/extras/Rhythm.gif?t=1724236796\" /><br>2. There are multiple cool skills to obtain, and skills can also cause powerful damage when combined with the right rhythm timing!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164170/extras/Skills.gif?t=1724236796\" /><br>3. Crazy enemies will attack you mercilessly, and enemies will also release powerful skills to hit you, and each map series has a corresponding boss, who can release stronger skills, with higher difficulty, and of course you will get richer rewards after defeating the enemy!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164170/extras/\u602a.gif?t=1724236796\" /><br>4. As the map level and progress, you will unlock stronger skills, and as the level increases, you can strengthen your favorite skills. Can you disperse the enemy?<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164170/extras/ezgif-6-b0a2c61d60.gif?t=1724236796\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3164170?t=1724236796","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3164170?t=1724236796","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164170/131a95d0becfe74ebd96f7e21483443f867bb50d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1724236796","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com